        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Great and honest people. Friendly staff and very professional. Bought a forklift from them and it has been going strong for over a year.",
        "time": 1601556085,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kevin Boyer",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109640814743870239953/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVKTTuZH-Ugd0K-haPwom3AcaQknSrXzhcsobvpHCeFfOWVg4oA0A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I had my lift serviced by this company and could not be happier! They come to you no questions asked.. very polite and professional. Also a mechanic with the knowledge to solve any issue at hand. Not to mention the competitive Prices they offer compared to the dealer, Unbeatable\nThanks again for the great service!",
        "time": 1572380194,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alique Remtulla Langlois",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102814574601718836963/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVdJMFxI99VNtNLI5EpiZ7LJXIN6KS1s75usW_6szV8xTNJoz_5yg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "This family owned business is dedicated to its customers. They go above and beyond for those who show them respect and the equipment they service. If I had to choose them over a manufacturers maintenance service tech I would do it in a heartbeat. I know they will do a better job, not to mention at better price.",
        "time": 1572380972,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Patrick Abouzakhm",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117181837079256534224/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIpv9y0sgADfCk8IdiI0lfN5Lqriz-T4B-tYyiMRQz4Bdwlug=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I have done business with this company several times now for various issues and have left each time extremely satisfied! Very knowledgeable and amazing customer service. I would recommend to everyone and will definitely continue to return here!",
